\item[S1] ULAM.AI and the UnsolvedMath Contributors, UnsolvedMath: A Curated Collection of Open Mathematics Problems, record 5300084 (AMR-052-0084). CC BY 4.0. \url{https://huggingface.co/datasets/ulamai/UnsolvedMath}.
\item[S2] Ben Bielefeld (editor) and conference contributors, \emph{Conformal Dynamics Problem List}, arXiv:math/9201271v1 (1990), Curt McMullen, \S5, Geometrically finite rational maps, Problem 1, printed p. 11. \url{https://arxiv.org/abs/math/9201271v1}.
